{"4011830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reikoneo: Purge Protocol", "steam_appid": 4011830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reikoneo: Purge Protocol is a third person shooter with light fighting game mechanics and a linear PS2 style campaign. Follow the story of Nyx, an android with the memories of a human. Shoot, punch, kick, disarm and stun your way through a cyberpunk anime city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Save Humanity</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/6e48f6dd039f3803c70997e0409530fa.poster.avif?t=1786764411\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/6e48f6dd039f3803c70997e0409530fa.webm?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/6e48f6dd039f3803c70997e0409530fa.mp4?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Eralysium, the last city on Earth. Ten thousand years after an AI apocalypse nearly erased humanity, the city still stands with a single purpose: the preservation of the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divided into sealed districts that can be locked down during a crisis, Eralysium’s ultimate safeguard is known as the Purge Protocol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the City </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/20c18ddb531f96f1320894112ab32034.poster.avif?t=1786764411\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/20c18ddb531f96f1320894112ab32034.webm?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/20c18ddb531f96f1320894112ab32034.mp4?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When disaster strikes, androids are deployed to restore order and evacuate the innocent. These androids are built from the minds of the most selfless individuals who have already passed on, ensuring only the finest are granted this authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Nyx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrown into the worst purge of her service, she must battle through chaos while confronting a deeper question: where does the true divide between human and android begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scrappy Gun-fu</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/2f47a37c1c5c55a0beb7b583eec18cf0.poster.avif?t=1786764411\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/2f47a37c1c5c55a0beb7b583eec18cf0.webm?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/2f47a37c1c5c55a0beb7b583eec18cf0.mp4?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won’t be a clean fight. You’ll get hit, knocked down, disarmed, and thrown. But every one of those techniques is also yours. Seize every opening and complete the mission. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person shooter with light fighting-game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide arsenal of weapons including pistols, shotguns, SMGs, sniper rifles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your gun to stun and disarm enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your movement shape your fighting style with an intuitive directional combat system. Move left and punch for a side strike, crouch and kick for a leg sweep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies’ kinetic energy against them: Absorb ballistic bullet damage to charge your kinetic barrier, close the gap, then discharge it to amplify your melee attacks, or risk a violent burst if it overfills. (Making fists a viable threat against firearms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrappy, physical combat where both you and your enemies can be knocked down, grappled, disarmed, or thrown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, story-driven campaign in the spirit of classic PS2-era adventures</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reikoneo: Purge Protocol is a third person shooter with light fighting game mechanics and a linear PS2 style campaign. Follow the story of Nyx, an android with the memories of a human. Shoot, punch, kick, disarm and stun your way through a cyberpunk anime city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Save Humanity</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/6e48f6dd039f3803c70997e0409530fa.poster.avif?t=1786764411\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/6e48f6dd039f3803c70997e0409530fa.webm?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/6e48f6dd039f3803c70997e0409530fa.mp4?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Eralysium, the last city on Earth. Ten thousand years after an AI apocalypse nearly erased humanity, the city still stands with a single purpose: the preservation of the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divided into sealed districts that can be locked down during a crisis, Eralysium’s ultimate safeguard is known as the Purge Protocol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the City </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/20c18ddb531f96f1320894112ab32034.poster.avif?t=1786764411\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/20c18ddb531f96f1320894112ab32034.webm?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/20c18ddb531f96f1320894112ab32034.mp4?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When disaster strikes, androids are deployed to restore order and evacuate the innocent. These androids are built from the minds of the most selfless individuals who have already passed on, ensuring only the finest are granted this authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Nyx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrown into the worst purge of her service, she must battle through chaos while confronting a deeper question: where does the true divide between human and android begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scrappy Gun-fu</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/2f47a37c1c5c55a0beb7b583eec18cf0.poster.avif?t=1786764411\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/2f47a37c1c5c55a0beb7b583eec18cf0.webm?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/extras/2f47a37c1c5c55a0beb7b583eec18cf0.mp4?t=1786764411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won’t be a clean fight. You’ll get hit, knocked down, disarmed, and thrown. But every one of those techniques is also yours. Seize every opening and complete the mission. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person shooter with light fighting-game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide arsenal of weapons including pistols, shotguns, SMGs, sniper rifles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your gun to stun and disarm enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your movement shape your fighting style with an intuitive directional combat system. Move left and punch for a side strike, crouch and kick for a leg sweep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies’ kinetic energy against them: Absorb ballistic bullet damage to charge your kinetic barrier, close the gap, then discharge it to amplify your melee attacks, or risk a violent burst if it overfills. (Making fists a viable threat against firearms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrappy, physical combat where both you and your enemies can be knocked down, grappled, disarmed, or thrown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, story-driven campaign in the spirit of classic PS2-era adventures</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Reikoneo: Purge Protocol is a third-person shooter with light fighting-game mechanics and a linear story campaign. Follow the story of Nyx, an android with the memories of a human. Shoot, punch, kick, disarm, and stun your way through a cyberpunk anime city.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/77a7967449670d6575b8a3480b42a7042171f1cf/header.jpg?t=1786764411", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/28a0ba04856e702e48b36651ca10223f9d4861e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786764411", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011830/28a0ba04856e702e48b36651ca10223f9d4861e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786764411", "website": "https://raptagonstudios.com/reikoneo/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600 Six-Core Procressor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce RTX 3070 ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Raptagon Studios"], "publishe